      "detailCue": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s39",
      "start": 470.8,
      "end": 480.3666666666667,
      "kind": "statement",
      "title": "AI is still surprising me.",
      "sub": "I want to feel the next improvement in real work.",
      "nodes": [],
      "media": null,
      "facts": [
        "closing-judgment"
      ],
      "sources": [],
      "rail": "AARON’S NOTES · REAL WORK",
      "tension": false,
      "cues": [
        0.5
      ],
      "detailCue": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s40",
      "start": 480.3666666666667,
      "end": 485.3666666666667,
      "kind": "end",
      "title": "AARON GUO",
      "sub": "AI-NATIVE BUILDER · Human-first thinker",
      "nodes": [],
      "media": null,
      "facts": [],
      "sources": [],
      "rail": "",
      "tension": false,
      "cues": [
        0.5
      ],
      "detailCue": 1.0
    }
  ],
  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 3.0,
      "end": 7.063,
      "text": "You've probably seen Astra build games and beautiful 3D scenes."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.166,
      "end": 10.79,
      "text": "I've been using it on something harder to show in"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.847999999999999,
      "end": 14.447,
      "text": "a short clip: a deployment across Azure,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.598,
      "end": 17.176000000000002,
      "text": "Linux, Windows, and a database."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.279,
      "end": 20.845,
      "text": "It involved networking, certificates,"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.995,
      "end": 23.016,
      "text": "and real problems along the way."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.968,
      "end": 27.973,
      "text": "That experience changed how much of a job I'm willing"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.031,
      "end": 31.676828,
      "text": "to give AI. I've also been using it for everyday"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.734828,
      "end": 35.205828,
      "text": "writing, where the prose has felt more natural."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.459828,
      "end": 40.290828,
      "text": "So I looked at my experience alongside the documentation and"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.441828,
      "end": 44.191828,
      "text": "early public reports. Six things stand out."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.969828,
      "end": 47.349828,
      "text": "The question connecting them is simple:"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.464828,
      "end": 52.051828,
      "text": "what happens when Astra has an actual job to carry,"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.376828,
      "end": 57.380828,
      "text": "inside the systems and tools we already use?"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.381134,
      "end": 62.942134,
      "text": "First, complex deployment. The business application ran on Linux."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.256134,
      "end": 65.729134,
      "text": "The reporting engine needed Windows."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.49513400000001,
      "end": 69.455134,
      "text": "I wanted a request to travel from the application to"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.571134,
      "end": 74.006134,
      "text": "a Windows service, produce a PDF using the database,"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.169134,
      "end": 76.514134,
      "text": "and return it to the business system."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.46613400000001,
      "end": 81.22813400000001,
      "text": "Existing connections and workflows still had to work."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.18013400000001,
      "end": 84.52513400000001,
      "text": "That was the real job behind the words,"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.64113400000001,
      "end": 88.960717,
      "text": "Windows Worker. The work included Azure resources,"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.23871700000001,
      "end": 93.871717,
      "text": "private networking, a new subnet attached to an existing NAT"
    },
    {
      "start": 93.975717,
      "end": 96.761717,
      "text": "Gateway, Windows service installation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.145717,
      "end": 99.07271700000001,
      "text": "and SQL certificate trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.885717,
      "end": 103.205717,
      "text": "Astra advanced those steps within my authorization."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.029717,
      "end": 108.44171700000001,
      "text": "I decided the scope and approved changes that could affect"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.59271700000001,
      "end": 113.97971700000001,
      "text": "services. But I wasn't switching into every tool to perform"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.06071700000001,
      "end": 120.39971700000001,
      "text": "the implementation myself. That made the experience feel very different."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.400091,
      "end": 122.826091,
      "text": "Azure rejected an early network rule."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.546091,
      "end": 127.087091,
      "text": "Database connectivity brought certificate checks."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.22509100000002,
      "end": 130.280091,
      "text": "Later, the PDF existed,"
    },
    {
      "start": 130.884091,
      "end": 132.927091,
      "text": "but saving the attachment failed."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.310091,
      "end": 135.598091,
      "text": "The work continued through diagnosis,"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.749091,
      "end": 137.978091,
      "text": "read-back, and retry checks,"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.164091,
      "end": 140.091091,
      "text": "until the chain worked in Dev."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.788091,
      "end": 143.771091,
      "text": "What impressed me was connecting infrastructure,"
    },
    {
      "start": 143.922091,
      "end": 148.996091,
      "text": "code, troubleshooting, and verification inside one task."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.692091,
      "end": 153.419091,
      "text": "The value was in carrying those pieces together."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.418867,
      "end": 156.483867,
      "text": "Second, the tools are becoming more connected."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.470867,
      "end": 161.04686700000002,
      "text": "OpenAI's showcases include a Blender house model,"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.290867,
      "end": 164.424867,
      "text": "an Unreal scene, and a racing game."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.26086700000002,
      "end": 168.198867,
      "text": "Another compares clinic routes in Google Maps."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.918867,
      "end": 170.752867,
      "text": "These are official demonstrations,"
    },
    {
      "start": 170.822867,
      "end": 175.60586700000002,
      "text": "not my reproductions. I look at them for the handoffs:"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.720867,
      "end": 179.738867,
      "text": "a result in one place becoming the input to the"
    },
    {
      "start": 179.80886700000002,
      "end": 185.544091,
      "text": "next step. Matt Shumer describes browser work on newsletters,"
    },
    {
      "start": 185.857091,
      "end": 189.154091,
      "text": "inboxes, and advertising interfaces."
    },
    {
      "start": 189.572091,
      "end": 193.880091,
      "text": "A flight-game developer reports using Godot and Blender,"
    },
    {
      "start": 194.298091,
      "end": 196.097091,
      "text": "with feedback along the way."
    },
    {
      "start": 196.515091,
      "end": 198.953091,
      "text": "The useful combination includes code,"
    },
    {
      "start": 199.185091,
      "end": 201.972091,
      "text": "applications, and tool connections."
    },
    {
      "start": 202.738091,
      "end": 206.372091,
      "text": "Research, create, inspect, continue."
    },
    {
      "start": 207.266091,
      "end": 210.900091,
      "text": "Each handoff the agent handles is one less point where"
    },
    {
      "start": 211.00409100000002,
      "end": 212.920091,
      "text": "I have to take the task back."
    },
    {
      "start": 213.686091,
      "end": 217.320091,
      "text": "Access and available tools still matter."
    },
    {
      "start": 217.320182,
      "end": 223.68218199999998,
      "text": "Third, long tasks. Codex documents experimental context management with notes"
    },
    {
      "start": 223.72918199999998,
      "end": 227.90818199999998,
      "text": "and searchable history. It is currently off by default."
    },
    {
      "start": 228.66318199999998,
      "end": 230.567182,
      "text": "The idea is straightforward:"
    },
    {
      "start": 231.043182,
      "end": 233.55118199999998,
      "text": "when a job grows beyond the current context,"
    },
    {
      "start": 233.620182,
      "end": 235.93118199999998,
      "text": "earlier details remain retrievable."
    },
    {
      "start": 237.04518199999998,
      "end": 241.48018199999999,
      "text": "Imagine a refactor where a dependency cannot be upgraded."
    },
    {
      "start": 242.595182,
      "end": 248.202182,
      "text": "Hours later, the reason for that decision still matters."
    },
    {
      "start": 248.202722,
      "end": 252.76572199999998,
      "text": "In that example, a useful record includes the migration that"
    },
    {
      "start": 252.881722,
      "end": 255.79572199999998,
      "text": "failed and what the tests revealed."
    },
    {
      "start": 256.399722,
      "end": 259.858722,
      "text": "Recovering it could prevent another trip down the same dead"
    },
    {
      "start": 259.928722,
      "end": 263.992722,
      "text": "end. This is an illustration of the documented feature."
    },
    {
      "start": 265.10772199999997,
      "end": 268.973722,
      "text": "It matters because long jobs accumulate discoveries."
    },
    {
      "start": 270.087722,
      "end": 274.116722,
      "text": "I want the context invested early in a task to"
    },
    {
      "start": 274.197722,
      "end": 277.599722,
      "text": "keep helping as the work moves on."
    },
    {
      "start": 277.599185,
      "end": 280.827185,
      "text": "Fourth, initiative has to work with direction."
    },
    {
      "start": 281.512185,
      "end": 283.59018499999996,
      "text": "I want the model to keep going,"
    },
    {
      "start": 284.089185,
      "end": 287.003185,
      "text": "while understanding a condition I add along the way."
    },
    {
      "start": 287.688185,
      "end": 290.81118499999997,
      "text": "If I say, keep this in the test environment,"
    },
    {
      "start": 291.183185,
      "end": 293.05218499999995,
      "text": "that changes the next steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 293.853185,
      "end": 296.442185,
      "text": "My view is that upgrading the model is also a"
    },
    {
      "start": 296.48918499999996,
      "end": 300.16918499999997,
      "text": "good time to review our old skills."
    },
    {
      "start": 300.168981,
      "end": 304.17398099999997,
      "text": "OpenAI recommends auditing skills and instruction files."
    },
    {
      "start": 305.04498099999995,
      "end": 309.28298099999995,
      "text": "Ambiguous or conflicting rules can make Astra stop too early."
    },
    {
      "start": 310.454981,
      "end": 313.218981,
      "text": "I would replace ask me after every step with a"
    },
    {
      "start": 313.276981,
      "end": 316.050981,
      "text": "clear goal, acceptance criteria,"
    },
    {
      "start": 316.23698099999996,
      "end": 318.36198099999996,
      "text": "and meaningful decision points."
    },
    {
      "start": 319.44098099999997,
      "end": 326.00098099999997,
      "text": "Scope still matters: one developer reported unwanted infrastructure and premature"
    },
    {
      "start": 326.047981,
      "end": 329.97198099999997,
      "text": "implementation. Better instructions help,"
    },
    {
      "start": 330.34298099999995,
      "end": 335.091981,
      "text": "but the model remains responsible for understanding the job."
    },
    {
      "start": 335.091793,
      "end": 337.935793,
      "text": "Fifth, the writing feels more natural."
    },
    {
      "start": 338.771793,
      "end": 341.442793,
      "text": "Recent drafts connect ideas more easily,"
    },
    {
      "start": 341.651793,
      "end": 343.926793,
      "text": "and the prose is more pleasant to read."
    },
    {
      "start": 344.901793,
      "end": 347.316793,
      "text": "I often begin with scattered thoughts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 347.607793,
      "end": 351.252793,
      "text": "project experiences, and a point I'm still finding."
    },
    {
      "start": 352.401793,
      "end": 355.014793,
      "text": "When those become a coherent article,"
    },
    {
      "start": 355.223793,
      "end": 357.301793,
      "text": "I can focus on what I mean to say."
    },
    {
      "start": 358.113793,
      "end": 361.747793,
      "text": "That's the improvement I feel in my writing workflow."
    },
    {
      "start": 361.74830099999997,
      "end": 365.33530099999996,
      "text": "A concrete experience leads into an observation."
    },
    {
      "start": 366.25330099999996,
      "end": 370.21230099999997,
      "text": "The next paragraph picks up the question it leaves behind."
    },
    {
      "start": 370.88530099999997,
      "end": 373.64830099999995,
      "text": "I like the writing we're producing together more."
    },
    {
      "start": 374.577301,
      "end": 376.17930099999995,
      "text": "This is my experience,"
    },
    {
      "start": 376.295301,
      "end": 380.55630099999996,
      "text": "with our existing context and preferences contributing too."
    },
    {
      "start": 381.670301,
      "end": 384.16730099999995,
      "text": "I still tell it who the reader is and what"
    },
    {
      "start": 384.22530099999994,
      "end": 389.12430099999995,
      "text": "tone I want. Those choices help the expression fit the"
    },
    {
      "start": 389.182301,
      "end": 396.985004,
      "text": "piece. Sixth, cost. The flight-game developer reported about three hours"
    },
    {
      "start": 397.043004,
      "end": 401.118004,
      "text": "and forty-five percent of a Pro plan's weekly allowance."
    },
    {
      "start": 402.163004,
      "end": 405.367004,
      "text": "Other users describe running out before finishing."
    },
    {
      "start": 405.843004,
      "end": 407.515004,
      "text": "Those are individual reports,"
    },
    {
      "start": 407.54900399999997,
      "end": 409.639004,
      "text": "but they make the tradeoff visible."
    },
    {
      "start": 410.243004,
      "end": 413.308004,
      "text": "I would use a lighter model for a small edit,"
    },
    {
      "start": 413.91200399999997,
      "end": 418.277004,
      "text": "and consider Astra when the work spans systems,"
    },
    {
      "start": 418.788004,
      "end": 424.535183,
      "text": "troubleshooting, and verification. These experiences change what I'm willing to"
    },
    {
      "start": 424.616183,
      "end": 428.656183,
      "text": "delegate. I feel more confident giving Astra long,"
    },
    {
      "start": 428.714183,
      "end": 432.139183,
      "text": "complex tasks across products and systems,"
    },
    {
      "start": 432.290183,
      "end": 434.740183,
      "text": "within a clear goal and scope."
    },
    {
      "start": 435.460183,
      "end": 437.991183,
      "text": "Greater autonomy brings new questions:"
    },
    {
      "start": 438.52518299999997,
      "end": 442.089183,
      "text": "how do I verify the result and trace the important"
    },
    {
      "start": 442.136183,
      "end": 446.826183,
      "text": "decisions? Verification and auditing need more attention."
    },
    {
      "start": 447.778183,
      "end": 449.659183,
      "text": "So does the higher price."
    },
    {
      "start": 450.599183,
      "end": 454.756183,
      "text": "I'm honestly tempted to pay for another high-allowance subscription."
    },
    {
      "start": 455.557183,
      "end": 458.982183,
      "text": "Seeing useful work get done makes me want more room"
    },
    {
      "start": 459.063183,
      "end": 463.545029,
      "text": "to use it. Those questions haven't taken away my excitement."
    },
    {
      "start": 464.357029,
      "end": 467.387029,
      "text": "I want the work I still have to watch closely"
    },
    {
      "start": 467.457029,
      "end": 469.849029,
      "text": "to become work I can trust it with."
    },
    {
      "start": 470.80102899999997,
      "end": 473.819029,
      "text": "AI is still finding ways to surprise me."
    },
    {
      "start": 474.423029,
      "end": 476.850029,
      "text": "I'm looking forward to it getting better,"
    },
    {
      "start": 477.094029,
      "end": 480.356029,
      "text": "and to feeling those improvements in real work."
    }
  ]
}